{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29762","headline":"海上谣 · 李商隐","name":"海上谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂水寒於江，玉兔秋冷咽。\n海底觅仙人，香桃如瘦骨。\n紫鸾不肯舞，满翅蓬山雪。\n借得龙堂宽，晓出揲云髪。\n刘郎旧香炷，立见茂陵树。\n云孙帖帖卧秋烟，上元细字如蚕眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}